# No Backward Compatibility
RULE: Never add fallbacks, legacy aliases, or dual-format support. Fail fast with clear error.
WHY: Violates codex; fallbacks hide migration issues.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/README.md, .cursor/rules/delete-deprecated.mdc
DO: Bump version; update all consumers; remove old code; document migration
NEVER: try/except import fallbacks; config.old or config.new; alias for backward compat
